Descriptor Disability
    documentation 'This descriptor defines a student's impairment.
    enumeration DisabilityCategory
        documentation 'Whether the disability code is IDEA, Section 504, or other disability 
        'designation.
        is required

    with optional map type
        item Autism Spectrum Disorders
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Deaf-Blindness
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Hearing Impairment, including Deafness
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Intellectual Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Infant/Toddler with a Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Medical condition
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of Section 504
        item Mental impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of Section 504
        item Motor impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of Section 504
        item Multiple Disabilities
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Orthopedic Impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Other
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of Section 504
        item Other Health Impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Physical Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Preschooler with a Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Sensory impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of Section 504
        item Serious Emotional Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Speech or Language Impairment
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Specific Learning Disability
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Traumatic Brain Injury
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
        item Visual Impairment, including Blindness
            documentation 'This disability falls in the DisabilityCategory of IDEA
			